401(k) survey data

The sipp401k dataset is distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution
4.0 International license (CC BY 4.0).
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Original survey: U.S. Census Bureau, Survey of Income and Program
Participation, 1990 panel, wave 4 (1991).
https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sipp/data/datasets/1990-panel/wave-4.html

Source: Achim Ahrens, Victor Chernozhukov, Christian Hansen, Damian Kozbur,
Mark Schaffer and Thomas Wiemann (2026). Repository for "An Introduction to
Double/Debiased Machine Learning", version 5. Harvard Dataverse.
https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/T81OHQ

The R data frame retains 11 of the 14 variables in the archived Stata file,
in their original units and household order. The columns have been reordered.
